<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-tag">Writing Task 2 — Structure Guide — All 5 Essay Types</div>
  <h1 class="hero-title">Task 2<br /><em>Structure Guide</em></h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">Sentence-slot templates, variation switchers, and key notes for Band 7–9 — one page, five essay types.</p>
  <div class="hero-meta">
    <div class="hero-stat">
      <div class="hero-stat-num">5</div>
      <div class="hero-stat-label">Dạng bài</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat">
      <div class="hero-stat-num">4</div>
      <div class="hero-stat-label">Paragraphs</div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-stat">
      <div class="hero-stat-num">7–9</div>
      <div class="hero-stat-label">Band Target</div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-scroll">Scroll to explore</div>
</section>

<div class="guide-body">

  <!-- 01: Opinion Essay -->
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="section-number">01</span> Opinion Essay — Agree / Disagree
  </div>
  <div class="identify-banner">
    <span class="identify-label">How to identify</span>
    <span class="id-chip">"To what extent do you agree or disagree?"</span>
    <span class="id-chip">"Do you agree or disagree?"</span>
  </div>

  <div class="variation-label">Variation A — Strong stance <span class="vbadge">Safer for most students</span></div>
  <div class="para-section para-intro">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Introduction</span><span class="para-words">60–80 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item">
        <span class="slot-num intro-num">1</span>
        <div class="slot-content">
          <div class="slot-role">Hook</div>
          <div class="slot-template">"Paraphrase the topic — do NOT copy the question wording."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item">
        <span class="slot-num intro-num">2</span>
        <div class="slot-content">
          <div class="slot-role">Thesis</div>
          <div class="slot-template">"I completely agree/disagree that S + V, and this essay will outline the reasons for my position."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="para-section para-body1">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Body Paragraph 1</span><span class="para-words">90–110 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item">
        <span class="slot-num body1-num">3</span>
        <div class="slot-content">
          <div class="slot-role">Topic Sentence</div>
          <div class="slot-template">"The primary reason for this view is that S + V."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item">
        <span class="slot-num body1-num">4</span>
        <div class="slot-content">
          <div class="slot-role">Support</div>
          <div class="triplet-chips">
            <span class="chip body1-chip">Explanation</span>
            <span class="chip body1-chip">Effect</span>
            <span class="chip body1-chip">Example</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item">
        <span class="slot-num body1-num">5</span>
        <div class="slot-content">
          <div class="slot-role">Example Link</div>
          <div class="slot-template">"This demonstrates that S + V."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="para-section para-body2">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Body Paragraph 2</span><span class="para-words">90–110 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item">
        <span class="slot-num body2-num">6</span>
        <div class="slot-content">
          <div class="slot-role">Topic Sentence</div>
          <div class="slot-template">"Furthermore, S + V."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item">
        <span class="slot-num body2-num">7</span>
        <div class="slot-content">
          <div class="slot-role">Support</div>
          <div class="triplet-chips">
            <span class="chip body2-chip">Explanation</span>
            <span class="chip body2-chip">Effect</span>
            <span class="chip body2-chip">Example</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item">
        <span class="slot-num body2-num">8</span>
        <div class="slot-content">
          <div class="slot-role">Example Link</div>
          <div class="slot-template">"This further illustrates that S + V."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="para-section para-concl">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Conclusion</span><span class="para-words">50–70 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item">
        <span class="slot-num concl-num">9</span>
        <div class="slot-content">
          <div class="slot-role">Restate</div>
          <div class="slot-template">"In conclusion, it is clear that S + V."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item">
        <span class="slot-num concl-num">10</span>
        <div class="slot-content">
          <div class="slot-role">Final Thought</div>
          <div class="slot-template">"Therefore, I firmly believe that S + V."</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <details class="variation-alt">
    <summary>Variation B — Partial stance <span class="vbadge vbadge-alt">Higher band potential</span></summary>
    <div class="para-section para-intro">
      <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Introduction</span><span class="para-words">60–80 words</span></div>
      <div class="slot-list">
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num intro-num">1</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Hook</div><div class="slot-template">"Paraphrase the topic."</div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num intro-num">2</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Acknowledge</div><div class="slot-template">"While it is true that S + V,"</div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num intro-num">3</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Thesis</div><div class="slot-template">"I would argue that S + V to a greater extent."</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="para-section para-body1">
      <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Body Paragraph 1 — Opposing View</span><span class="para-words">90–110 words</span></div>
      <div class="slot-list">
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">4</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Frame</div><div class="slot-template">"Those who [take the opposing position] may argue that S + V."</div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">5</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body1-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">6</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Concession Close</div><div class="slot-template">"This shows that there is some validity to the claim that S + V."</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="para-section para-body2">
      <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Body Paragraph 2 — Your View</span><span class="para-words">90–110 words</span></div>
      <div class="slot-list">
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">7</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Pivot</div><div class="slot-template">"Nevertheless, I believe that S + V for several reasons."</div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">8</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Reason 1</div><div class="slot-template">"Chief among these is that S + V."</div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">9</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body2-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">10</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Reason 2</div><div class="slot-template">"Furthermore, S + V."</div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">11</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body2-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="para-section para-concl">
      <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Conclusion</span><span class="para-words">50–70 words</span></div>
      <div class="slot-list">
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num concl-num">12</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Restate</div><div class="slot-template">"In conclusion, while it is understandable that some S + V,"</div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num concl-num">13</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Final</div><div class="slot-template">"I maintain that S + V."</div></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="key-notes">
    <summary>Key Notes &amp; Common Mistakes</summary>
    <ul class="notes-list">
      <li class="note-item"><span class="note-warn">⚠</span> Never sit on the fence — "to what extent" still requires ONE clear side</li>
      <li class="note-item"><span class="note-ok">✓</span> Avoid "I think" — use "I believe", "I would argue", "It is my contention that"</li>
      <li class="note-item"><span class="note-warn">⚠</span> Do NOT restate the question word-for-word in your hook</li>
      <li class="note-item"><span class="note-ok">✓</span> Variation B shows more critical thinking — better for Band 7+</li>
    </ul>
  </details>

  <!-- 02: Discussion Essay -->
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="section-number">02</span> Discussion Essay — Discuss Both Views
  </div>
  <div class="identify-banner">
    <span class="identify-label">How to identify</span>
    <span class="id-chip">"Discuss both views and give your own opinion"</span>
    <span class="id-chip">"Some believe... Others argue..."</span>
  </div>

  <div class="variation-label">Variation A — Standard</div>
  <div class="para-section para-intro">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Introduction</span><span class="para-words">60–80 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num intro-num">1</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Hook</div><div class="slot-template">"Opinions are divided on whether S1 + V1 or whether S2 + V2."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num intro-num">2</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Thesis</div><div class="slot-template">"While I understand the logic behind the former view, I am still in favour of the latter."</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="para-section para-body1">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Body Paragraph 1 — View 1 (the view you disagree with more)</span><span class="para-words">90–110 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">3</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Frame</div><div class="slot-template">"Those who believe that S1 + V1 may have several arguments."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">4</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Argument 1</div><div class="slot-template">"They may well argue that S + V."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">5</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body1-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">6</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Argument 2</div><div class="slot-template">"Another possible argument is that S + V."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">7</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body1-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="para-section para-body2">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Body Paragraph 2 — Your View</span><span class="para-words">90–110 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">8</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Pivot</div><div class="slot-template">"Nevertheless, I still believe that S2 + V2 for several reasons."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">9</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Reason 1</div><div class="slot-template">"Chief among these is that S + V."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">10</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body2-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">11</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Reason 2</div><div class="slot-template">"The second reason is that S + V."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">12</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body2-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="para-section para-concl">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Conclusion</span><span class="para-words">50–70 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num concl-num">13</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Acknowledge</div><div class="slot-template">"In conclusion, it is understandable why some may argue that S1 + V1."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num concl-num">14</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Final</div><div class="slot-template">"However, I would take the view that S2 + V2."</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <details class="variation-alt">
    <summary>Variation B — With Antithesis <span class="vbadge vbadge-alt">Band 7.5+</span></summary>
    <div class="info-note" style="background:#fff1f2; border-color:#fda4af; color:#9f1239;">
      <strong>What is antithesis?</strong> The writer introduces a limitation or counterpoint to View 1 <em>within</em> Body Paragraph 1 — then pivots to Body 2. This weakens the opposing argument before the writer even presents their own view.
    </div>
    <div class="para-section para-body1">
      <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Body Paragraph 1 — View 1 with Antithesis</span><span class="para-words">90–110 words</span></div>
      <div class="slot-list">
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">3</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Frame</div><div class="slot-template">"Those who believe that S1 + V1 may have several arguments."</div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">4</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Argument 1</div><div class="slot-template">"They may well argue that S + V."</div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">5</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body1-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">6</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Extended Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body1-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
        <div class="slot-connector"></div>
        <div class="slot-item slot-antithesis">
          <span class="slot-num antithesis-num">7</span>
          <div class="slot-content">
            <div class="slot-role" style="color:#be123c;">Antithesis</div>
            <div class="slot-template">"Nonetheless, S + V."</div>
            <div class="slot-annotation">← this weakens View 1 from within</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </details>

  <details class="key-notes">
    <summary>Key Notes &amp; Common Mistakes</summary>
    <ul class="notes-list">
      <li class="note-item"><span class="note-warn">⚠</span> You MUST give your own opinion — do not just describe both views neutrally</li>
      <li class="note-item"><span class="note-ok">✓</span> Body 1 presents the view you DISAGREE with more; Body 2 is YOUR view</li>
      <li class="note-item"><span class="note-ok">✓</span> "former view" = the first view mentioned in sentence 1; "latter" = the second</li>
      <li class="note-item"><span class="note-warn">⚠</span> Antithesis (Variation B) is powerful but requires careful logic — only use if confident</li>
    </ul>
  </details>

  <!-- 03: Adv/Disadv -->
  <div class="section-heading">
    <span class="section-number">03</span> Advantages / Disadvantages Essay
  </div>
  <div class="identify-banner">
    <span class="identify-label">How to identify</span>
    <span class="id-chip">"Discuss the advantages and disadvantages"</span>
    <span class="id-chip">"Do the advantages outweigh the disadvantages?"</span>
  </div>
  <div class="watchout" style="background:#fff1f2; border-color:#e11d48; color:#881337;">
    <strong>⚠ These two question types look similar but require completely different essay structures. Read the question carefully.</strong>
  </div>

  <div class="variation-label">Variation A — Discuss only, no opinion required</div>
  <div class="para-section para-intro">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Introduction</span><span class="para-words">60–80 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num intro-num">1</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Hook</div><div class="slot-template">"Paraphrase the topic — describe the trend or development."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num intro-num">2</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Thesis</div><div class="slot-template">"This essay will examine both the benefits and drawbacks of S + V."</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="para-section para-body1">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Body Paragraph 1 — Advantages</span><span class="para-words">90–110 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">3</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Topic</div><div class="slot-template">"There are several notable advantages to S + V."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">4</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Advantage 1</div><div class="slot-template">"The primary benefit is that S + V."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">5</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body1-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">6</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Advantage 2</div><div class="slot-template">"Furthermore, S + V."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body1-num">7</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body1-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body1-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="para-section para-body2">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Body Paragraph 2 — Disadvantages</span><span class="para-words">90–110 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">8</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Topic</div><div class="slot-template">"However, S + V also carries significant drawbacks."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">9</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Disadvantage 1</div><div class="slot-template">"The most notable concern is that S + V."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">10</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body2-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">11</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Disadvantage 2</div><div class="slot-template">"In addition, S + V."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num body2-num">12</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Support</div><div class="triplet-chips"><span class="chip body2-chip">Explanation</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Effect</span><span class="chip body2-chip">Example</span></div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="para-section para-concl">
    <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Conclusion</span><span class="para-words">50–70 words</span></div>
    <div class="slot-list">
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num concl-num">13</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Summarize</div><div class="slot-template">"In conclusion, while S + V brings clear advantages such as [X], it also presents challenges including [Y]."</div></div></div>
      <div class="slot-connector"></div>
      <div class="slot-item"><span class="slot-num concl-num">14</span><div class="slot-content"><div class="slot-role">Balanced Close</div><div class="slot-template">"The extent to which the benefits outweigh the drawbacks depends largely on [condition / individual context]."</div></div></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <details class="variation-alt">
    <summary>Variation B — Outweigh, opinion required <span class="vbadge vbadge-warn">Different thesis &amp; conclusion</span></summary>
    <div class="para-section para-intro">
      <div class="para-header"><span class="para-title">Introduction</span><span class="para-words">60–80 words</span></div>
